        "TileImage": "$($repository cea091ae-e6eb-40b7-9f81-a6d97e6e55f1).Image",
        "Description": "47 ,\r\rBy now you must already be aware why you are here in Bangkok again\rA 3rd group of Sleeper Cell Agents , this time with no alias , we will call them the &apos;Cerberus 3&apos; is here. \rICA has warned us that your targets are well aware of you and the blood you spilled before- on this very ground. This time it won&apos;t be an easy to blend in ,cherry pick your location to shoot &amp; hide. \rIt&apos;s a hit and run job and our contact will only be able to extract you out within the time limit. \r\rGood Luck , 47!",
